#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the User Account Manager"
msgstr "Schirmfoto vun den Brukerkonto-Pleger"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "The User Account Manager"
msgstr "De Brukerkonto-Pleger"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a system settings module to enter user information and configure "
"basic user settings such as the password and icon. This information and "
"these settings will be used by various &kde; applications (mail programs and "
"word processors for example) if they are filled. You can:"
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Systeeminstellenmoduul, binnen dat Du Dien Brukerinformatschonen "
"un Basis-Instellen as Dien Lüttbild un Dien Passwoort fastleggen kannst. "
"Disse Informatschonen un Instellen warrt vun verscheden &kde;-Programmen "
"bruukt (vun Nettpostprogrammen un Textverarbeiden as Bispill), wenn Du dor "
"wat rinschriffst. Du kannst:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "fill in personal information"
msgstr "Informatschonen to Dien Persoon angeven"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "change your user login password"
msgstr "Dien Anmell-Passwoort wesseln"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "set up the password prompt"
msgstr "den Passwoort-Wieser instellen"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Icon"
msgstr "Brukerlüttbild"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This icon is used when the user logs in using a login manager. Clicking on "
"it will allow you to change the image, either by using a provided icon or by "
"setting one of yours. Click <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> to validate your "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Dit Lüttbild warrt bruukt, wenn en Bruker sik mit en Anmellpleger anmellen "
"deit. Klickst Du dor op, kannst Du dat Bild wesseln - söök Di een ut oder "
"giff sülven een an. Klick op <guibutton>Bruken</guibutton>, wenn Du de "
"Ännern övernehmen wullt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>User Information</title>"
msgstr "<title>Bruker-Informatschonen</title>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Naam:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter here the full name of the user."
msgstr "Giff den helen Naam vun den Bruker in"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "Organisatschoon"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add the business or group that the user would like to be associated "
"with."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst de Sellschap oder den Koppel, na de oder den de Bruker tohören "
"will oder schall, hier ingeven."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "Nettpostadress:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter here the email address which will be associated with this user."
msgstr "Giff hier de Nettpostadress in, de den Bruker tohöört."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "SMTP-Server:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can indicate here a local smtp server for sending mail within a network."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du en lokaal SMTP-Server angeven, över den sik em Nettpost "
"binnen en Nettwark tostüern lett."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "User ID"
msgstr "Bruker-ID"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is an information only, it gives you your User ID. This number is "
"defined in <filename>/etc/passwd</filename> and was set when your user "
"account was created."
msgstr ""
"Dit is bloots en Informatschoon. De Tall steiht binnen <filename>/etc/"
"passwd</filename> un wöör bi't Opstellen vun Dien Konto fastslaan."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change password..."
msgstr "Passwoort wesseln..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking this button will display a dialog to change your user password. "
"Your user password is the one you log in your system with. You will be asked "
"for your current password then twice for your new password."
msgstr ""
"Klickst Du op dissen Knoop, dukt en Dialoog op, mit den Du Dien Bruker-"
"Passwoort ännern kannst. Dat is dat Passwoort, dat Du bi't Anmellen bruken "
"deist. Du warrst na Dien aktuell un denn tweemaal na't niege fraagt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "At Password Prompt"
msgstr "Bi't Ingeven vun't Passwoort"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section allows you to choose how you want to input your password when "
"you are asked for it. Default is to have one star for each letter you type. "
"You can change that to have three stars for each letter you type (making it "
"more difficult to guess the number of letters if someone is looking). You "
"can also choose to have nothing displayed while you type your password, "
"making this operation even more secure."
msgstr ""
"Disse Instellen leggt fast, wodennig Du dat Passwoort ingeven wullt, wenn Du "
"dor na fraagt warrst. Standardwies warrt een Steern för elkeen Bookstaav "
"wiest, den Du ingiffst. Du kannst dat op dree Steerns per Bookstaav ännern "
"(maakt dat sworer, dat en över-neeschierig Minsch de Tall vun Bookstaven "
"raden kann). Du kannst Di ok nix wiesen laten, denn warrt dat noch sekrer."
